1
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,540
(Howard:)So you got any special plans
with your sister?

2
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,980
(Raj:)Oh, not really. Just hang out.

3
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:13,650
(Sheldon:)I always tell people,
"If you have only one day

4
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:17,220
(Sheldon:)in Los Angeles,
make it a train day."

5
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,020
(Raj:)Train day?

6
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:22,390
(Sheldon:)The fun starts with brunch
at Carney's in Studio City,

7
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:25,530
a hotdog stand in a
converted railroad dining car.

8
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:26,660
(Sheldon:)Next stop, Travel Town,

9
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:30,970
(Sheldon:)an outdoor museum featuring
43 railroad engines,

10
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:34,570
(Sheldon:)cars, and other rolling stock
from the 1880s to the 1930s.

11
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:38,520
And, finally, we're off to the
glitz and glamour of Hollywood,

12
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:42,440
for dinner at--that's right--
the Hollywood Carney's,

13
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:47,310
a hotdog stand in a different
converted railroad dining car.

14
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:50,420
(Raj:)I don't think
we're going to do that.

15
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:53,850
(Sheldon:)Well, then apparently
you hate fun.

16
00:00:58,190 --> 00:01:00,290
(Leonard:)Priya's not back yet?

17
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:01,750
(Leonard:)Well, I guess
that's not unusual.

